      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "All you need you to is fix the cache (file name should be the hash of the url and not a random UID), and just \"document\" how they are added to the config (which is literally 2 sentences). Everything else is already implemented and documented. Please just take 5 minutes out of your day to fix this bug so that VCC can serve it's proper purpose.\n\nEDIT: The \"constant reload\" would still be there, but at least it would only hang for a second instead of over a minute (aka. be usable).",
